From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Project Luna <luna@localhost>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 12:59:01 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] x86: build Luna boot handoff Rust parser

Upstream base: Linux 7.2.4.

Add the Rust parser object to the x86 kernel build when CONFIG_RUST is
enabled. Parser source and the C ABI bridge are separate patches.

---
 arch/x86/kernel/Makefile | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

 diff --git a/arch/x86/kernel/Makefile b/arch/x86/kernel/Makefile
--- a/arch/x86/kernel/Makefile
+++ b/arch/x86/kernel/Makefile
@@ -89,4 +89,5 @@ obj-y += static_call.o
 obj-y += static_call.o
+
+obj-$(CONFIG_RUST) += luna_boot.o
 obj-y += process.o
 obj-y += fpu/
